  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The traditional darkling magic of the drow comes naturally to you.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Half-Drow Paragon<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can expend mythic power to use the mythic versions of any of your drow spell-like abilities. If you are able to cast any of those abilities as spells, you are considered to know those as mythic spells as well, as if you had taken the Mythic Spell Lore feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
